# MINERYON (MYRN)

## The Next Generation Mining & DeFi Ecosystem on Polygon

Mineryon (MYRN) is a Polygon-based ecosystem combining mining infrastructure, DeFi mechanics, real-time blockchain integrations, NFT utilities, transparency systems, and community-driven tools.

The ecosystem was designed around transparency, deterministic smart contract behavior, fixed-supply tokenomics, and expandable blockchain infrastructure.

