# Overview

MYRN is a fixed-supply ERC-20 token deployed on Polygon PoS.

The ecosystem integrates:

* Real-time mining systems
* Automated token mechanics
* Community mining tools
* Telegram integrations
* NFT infrastructure
* Dashboard utilities
* Transparency systems
* Blockchain monitoring
* DeFi ecosystem components

The protocol focuses on long-term ecosystem sustainability and transparent infrastructure development.

---

# Ecosystem Components

## Mining Infrastructure

Mineryon includes mining-oriented ecosystem mechanics integrated into the platform infrastructure.

Mining systems are designed to encourage:

* ecosystem participation
* long-term engagement
* community interaction
* token utility
* on-chain activity

