## Core Contracts

### Mineryon.sol

Core ERC-20 token contract.

### GenesisMarketVault.sol

Time-based ecosystem distribution infrastructure.

### MineryonMiningEscrow.sol

Mining and ecosystem expansion infrastructure module.

